@param initialOwner Owner permitted to set / rotate the oracle.
 @param factory_ The {IndexFactory} whose clones are authorized to
        create intents.
 @param attestationOracle_ Initial AttestationOracle address. May be
        zero at deploy time and set later via {setAttestationOracle},
        but `recordAttestation` reverts until set.

@inheritdoc IIntentQueue
 @dev Zero-amount guard mirrors {recordAttestation}: a colluding
      signer set could otherwise attest `deliveredAmount = 0` and
      force the terminal to under-pay this leg.

@inheritdoc IIntentQueue
 @dev Unified terminal: handles all-delivered, all-refunded, AND
      mixed-outcome resolutions. Releases the R3 lock. The
      IndexToken wrapper computes per-leg USDT payout vs share
      re-mint from the resolved leg state after this returns.
